<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;LOS ANGELES POLICE DEPARTMENT (LAPD)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Los Angeles Police Department (LAPD) is the primary law enforcement agency in Los Angeles, implementing the Strategic Extraction and Restoration Zones (SERZ) to predict and prevent crime."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOS ANGELES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Los Angeles is the city where the Strategic Extraction and Restoration Zones (SERZ) were implemented and later repurposed into art galleries."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STRATEGIC EXTRACTION AND RESTORATION ZONES (SERZ)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SERZ is a defunct policing software used by the LAPD to predict and prevent crime by identifying and targeting high-risk areas."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AFRICAN AMERICANS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"African Americans are a demographic group that faced disproportionate targeting by the SERZ algorithm."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LATINOS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Latinos are another demographic group that faced disproportionate targeting by the SERZ algorithm."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RAND CORPORATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"RAND Corporation conducted a study on the effectiveness of SERZ in reducing property crime."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ACLU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The American Civil Liberties Union (ACLU) released a report on the potential biases of the SERZ algorithm."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARIA RODRIGUEZ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Maria Rodriguez is a local artist whose work now adorns the walls of a former police hub transformed into an art gallery."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COUNCILMEMBER RACHEL KIM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Councilmember Rachel Kim championed the repurposing of the Strategic Extraction and Restoration Zones into art galleries."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EMILY CHEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Emily Chen is the curator of the SER zone gallery in Koreatown, overseeing the transformation and management of the space."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BOYLE HEIGHTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Boyle Heights is a neighborhood where the former SER zone was transformed into an art gallery."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KOREATOWN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Koreatown is a neighborhood where the former SER zone was transformed into an art gallery."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT DEPARTMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Economic Development Department is responsible for providing data on the economic impact of galleries in the city."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Economic Development Department provided data on the economic impact of the art galleries repurposed from former SER zones."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2010 STUDY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A 2010 study published in the Journal of Experimental Criminology found that SERZ led to a significant reduction in violent crime in Los Angeles."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2015 REPORT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A 2015 report by the RAND Corporation found that SERZ was effective in reducing property crime."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2018 REPORT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A 2018 report by the ACLU found that SERZ led to a significant increase in stops and searches of African Americans and Latinos."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2020&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"In 2020, the LAPD announced that it would be discontinuing the use of SERZ, citing concerns about bias and discrimination."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;25% DROP IN REPORTED INCIDENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Since the galleries opened, there has been a 25% drop in reported incidents in the surrounding neighborhoods."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;$1 MILLION IN REVENUE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The galleries have generated over $1 million in revenue since their opening, with a significant portion going towards local artists and small businesses."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GALLERIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Galleries are venues that generate revenue and support local artists and small businesses."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOCAL ARTISTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Local artists benefit from the revenue generated by the galleries."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SMALL BUSINESSES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Small businesses also benefit from the revenue generated by the galleries."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SER ZONES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SER zones are areas undergoing transformation, serving as a symbol of hope for the city."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The city is grappling with issues of policing and community relations while experiencing positive changes in certain areas."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CELEBRATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Celebration is an event bringing people from all walks of life together to honor creativity and diversity."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CREATIVITY AND DIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Creativity and diversity are the themes of the celebration, emphasizing inclusivity and innovation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POLICING AND COMMUNITY RELATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Policing and community relations are complex issues the city is dealing with, highlighting social challenges."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POSITIVE CHANGES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Positive changes in the SER zones represent improvements and optimism within the city."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0175</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;LOS ANGELES POLICE DEPARTMENT (LAPD)&quot;" target="&quot;STRATEGIC EXTRACTION AND RESTORATION ZONES (SERZ)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">26.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The LAPD discontinued the use of SERZ in 2020 due to concerns about bias and discrimination, moving towards more equitable crime-fighting strategies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The LAPD implemented SERZ to predict and prevent crime, using data-driven policing strategies."</data>
      <data key="d5">"discontinuation, bias concerns"&lt;SEP&gt;"policing strategy, crime prevention"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0175</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;LOS ANGELES&quot;" target="&quot;STRATEGIC EXTRACTION AND RESTORATION ZONES (SERZ)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"SERZ was implemented in Los Angeles to address crime issues in the city, with mixed results and eventual discontinuation."</data>
      <data key="d5">"city crime issue, implementation"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0175</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STRATEGIC EXTRACTION AND RESTORATION ZONES (SERZ)&quot;" target="&quot;AFRICAN AMERICANS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"SERZ disproportionately targeted African Americans, leading to increased stops and searches despite not being more likely to commit crimes."</data>
      <data key="d5">"racial bias, targeting"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0175</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STRATEGIC EXTRACTION AND RESTORATION ZONES (SERZ)&quot;" target="&quot;RAND CORPORATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"RAND Corporation studied the effectiveness of SERZ in reducing property crime, finding a 12% decrease in burglaries and a 10% decrease in thefts."</data>
      <data key="d5">"effectiveness, property crime reduction"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0175</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STRATEGIC EXTRACTION AND RESTORATION ZONES (SERZ)&quot;" target="&quot;ACLU&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The ACLU reported on the potential biases of the SERZ algorithm, highlighting its disproportionate targeting of communities of color."</data>
      <data key="d5">"bias, reporting"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0175</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STRATEGIC EXTRACTION AND RESTORATION ZONES (SERZ)&quot;" target="&quot;MARIA RODRIGUEZ&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Maria Rodriguez's artwork now adorns the walls of a former police hub transformed into an art gallery, symbolizing the transformation of the space."</data>
      <data key="d5">"artwork, transformation"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0175</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT DEPARTMENT&quot;" target="&quot;GALLERIES&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Economic Development Department provides data on the economic impact of the galleries."</data>
      <data key="d5">"data provision, economic impact"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0175</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GALLERIES&quot;" target="&quot;LOCAL ARTISTS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Galleries provide a platform for local artists to showcase their work and gain recognition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Galleries support local artists by generating revenue."</data>
      <data key="d5">"platform, support"&lt;SEP&gt;"support, economic benefit"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0175</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GALLERIES&quot;" target="&quot;SMALL BUSINESSES&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Galleries generate revenue that benefits local small businesses, fostering a supportive ecosystem."&lt;SEP&gt;"Galleries support small businesses by generating revenue."</data>
      <data key="d5">"economic benefit, support"&lt;SEP&gt;"support, economic benefit"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0175</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GALLERIES&quot;" target="&quot;CELEBRATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The celebration includes galleries as part of the event, showcasing artistic works and supporting local artists."</data>
      <data key="d5">"event component, artistic expression"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0175</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GALLERIES&quot;" target="&quot;POSITIVE CHANGES&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Galleries contribute to the positive changes in the SER zones by generating revenue and supporting local artists."</data>
      <data key="d5">"economic impact, community support"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0175</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SER ZONES&quot;" target="&quot;CITY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"SER zones serve as a symbol of hope for the city, representing positive changes in certain areas."</data>
      <data key="d5">"hope, transformation"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0175</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SER ZONES&quot;" target="&quot;POSITIVE CHANGES&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Positive changes in the SER zones are represented by the transformation of the galleries, symbolizing hope for the city."</data>
      <data key="d5">"symbol of hope, transformation"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0175</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CITY&quot;" target="&quot;POLICING AND COMMUNITY RELATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The city is grappling with issues of policing and community relations, highlighting ongoing social challenges."</data>
      <data key="d5">"social issues, community engagement"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0175</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CITY&quot;" target="&quot;POSITIVE CHANGES&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Positive changes in the SER zones serve as a beacon of hope for the city, addressing some of its social challenges."</data>
      <data key="d5">"hope, transformation"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0175</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CELEBRATION&quot;" target="&quot;CREATIVITY AND DIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The celebration aims to honor creativity and diversity, reflecting these core values."</data>
      <data key="d5">"theme, inclusivity"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0175</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
